  "title": "{{brand}} | Aesthetic and Dental Care in Greater Cairo",
  "description": "Explore skin, laser, nutrition and dental care at Soie Clinics in New Cairo and Mohandessin. Find branch details and book a consultation with reception.",
  "h1": "Unleash your beauty.",
  "updated": "2026-11-24",
  "html": "<section id=\"home\" class=\"sig-hero sig-wrap\" aria-labelledby=\"hero-title\">\n <div class=\"sig-hero-copy\"><p class=\"sig-eyebrow\" data-reveal><span class=\"sig-dot\"></span><span>New Cairo &amp; Mohandessin</span></p><h1 id=\"hero-title\"><span>Unleash</span><br><em>your beauty.</em></h1><p class=\"sig-lead\" data-reveal style=\"--delay:150ms\">Skin, body and dental care at {{brand}}. Take a little time to explore what feels right for you.</p><div class=\"sig-hero-actions\" data-reveal style=\"--delay:210ms\"><a href=\"/book\" class=\"sig-button\" data-open-booking><span>Book appointment</span><span class=\"sig-round-arrow\"><svg class=\"sig-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#sig-arrow\"></use></svg></span></a><a class=\"sig-text-link\" href=\"#care\"><span>Explore treatments</span><svg class=\"sig-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#sig-arrow\"></use></svg></a></div><p class=\"sig-hero-note\" data-reveal style=\"--delay:260ms\">From your first visit to aftercare.</p></div>\n <div class=\"sig-hero-art\"><figure class=\"sig-portrait\" style=\"margin:0\"><img src=\"/assets/images/cat-derma-900.webp\" alt=\"Beauty editorial portrait in natural light\" fetchpriority=\"high\" width=\"900\" height=\"502\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/assets/images/cat-derma-900.webp 900w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 720px) 90vw, 450px\"></figure><span class=\"sig-image-caption\" aria-hidden=\"true\">SOIE · AESTHETIC CARE</span><span class=\"sig-photo-index\" aria-hidden=\"true\">BEAUTY, IN YOUR OWN WAY.</span></div>\n</section>\n<div class=\"sig-hero-foot sig-wrap sig-rule\"><span>A considered approach. A personal experience.</span><a href=\"#care\"><span>Discover Soie</span><svg class=\"sig-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#sig-arrow\"></use></svg></a></div>\n<section class=\"sig-care sig-wrap sig-rule\" id=\"care\" aria-labelledby=\"care-title\"><div data-reveal><p class=\"sig-eyebrow\">01 / Our care</p><h2 class=\"sig-section-title\" id=\"care-title\">Find the care you need.</h2><p class=\"sig-section-copy\">Start with what you would like to improve. We can help you understand the options and decide where to begin.</p><a class=\"sig-text-link\" href=\"/treatments\"><span>All treatments</span><svg class=\"sig-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#sig-arrow\"></use></svg></a></div><div class=\"sig-services-list\" data-reveal style=\"--delay:100ms\"><a class=\"sig-service\" href=\"/treatments\"><span class=\"sig-service-no\">01</span><span><span class=\"sig-service-title\">Skin &amp; injectables</span><span class=\"sig-service-sub\">Facials, skin boosters, Botox and fillers</span></span><svg class=\"sig-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#sig-arrow\"></use></svg></a><a class=\"sig-service\" href=\"/treatments/laser\"><span class=\"sig-service-no\">02</span><span><span class=\"sig-service-title\">Laser &amp; body</span><span class=\"sig-service-sub\">Hair reduction, skin texture and body care</span></span><svg class=\"sig-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#sig-arrow\"></use></svg></a><a class=\"sig-service\" href=\"/dentistry\"><span class=\"sig-service-no\">03</span><span><span class=\"sig-service-title\">Dental care</span><span class=\"sig-service-sub\">Whitening, veneers and smile design</span></span><svg class=\"sig-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#sig-arrow\"></use></svg></a></div></section>\n<section class=\"sig-technology sig-wrap\" id=\"technology\" aria-labelledby=\"tech-title\" data-reveal><div class=\"sig-tech-head\"><div><p class=\"sig-eyebrow\">02 / Our technology</p><h2 class=\"sig-section-title\" id=\"tech-title\">Meet our devices.</h2></div><p class=\"sig-section-copy\">Learn what we use, how it works and what to ask at your consultation.</p></div><div class=\"device-grid\">\n      <a class=\"device-card\" href=\"/devices/indiba-deep-care\" aria-labelledby=\"home-indiba-title\">\n        <div class=\"device-card__image\"><img src=\"/assets/images/indiba-deep-care.webp\" alt=\"INDIBA Deep Care\" width=\"1801\" height=\"1683\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div>\n        <div class=\"device-card__body\">\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\">Radiofrequency care</p>\n          <h3 id=\"home-indiba-title\">INDIBA Deep Care</h3>\n          <p class=\"device-card__summary\">448 kHz radiofrequency for face and body care. Explore the technology, treatment considerations and a clinic session.</p>\n          <span class=\"device-card__link\"><span>Learn more</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></span>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n      <a class=\"device-card\" href=\"/devices/cutera-excel-hr\" aria-labelledby=\"home-cutera-title\">\n        <div class=\"device-card__image\"><img src=\"/assets/videos/posters/cutera-excel-hr.jpg\" alt=\"Cutera excel HR\" width=\"720\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div>\n        <div class=\"device-card__body\">\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\">Laser hair removal</p>\n          <h3 id=\"home-cutera-title\">Cutera excel HR</h3>\n          <p class=\"device-card__summary\">Laser care with 755 nm and 1064 nm wavelength options. Learn about hair reduction and see the device at the clinic.</p>\n          <span class=\"device-card__link\"><span>Learn more</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></span>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n      <a class=\"device-card\" href=\"/devices/finexel-fractional-co2\" aria-labelledby=\"home-finexel-title\">\n        <div class=\"device-card__image\"><img src=\"/assets/videos/posters/finexel-fractional-co2.jpg\" alt=\"FineXel CO2\" width=\"720\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div>\n        <div class=\"device-card__body\">\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\">Fractional CO2 laser</p>\n          <h3 id=\"home-finexel-title\">FineXel CO2</h3>\n          <p class=\"device-card__summary\">Fractional CO2 skin resurfacing. Read about texture, acne scars and recovery, and watch the clinic video.</p>\n          <span class=\"device-card__link\"><span>Learn more</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></span>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n    </div><a class=\"sig-text-link device-catalogue-link\" href=\"/devices\">Browse all devices</a></section>\n<div>{{homeReviews}}</div><section class=\"section testimonials sig-reviews\" id=\"testimonials\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <header class=\"section__head\" style=\"margin-bottom: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 3rem)\">\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\" data-reveal><span class=\"eyebrow__dot\"></span> From our clients</p>\n          <h2 class=\"section__title section__title--center\" data-reveal>Real client reviews</h2>\n          <p class=\"section__sub\" data-reveal>Messages from clients about their visits to {{brand}}. Tap a review to read it in full.</p>\n        </header>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"rv\" data-reveal>\n        <div class=\"rv__strip\" id=\"rvStrip\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Client review screenshots, scroll horizontally\">\n          <figure class=\"rv-shot\">\n            <img src=\"/assets/images/reviews/review-03.jpg\" alt=\"WhatsApp reviews about the clinic and skincare\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1179\" height=\"1175\">\n          </figure>\n          <figure class=\"rv-shot\">\n            <img src=\"/assets/images/reviews/review-08.jpg\" alt=\"Client WhatsApp review screenshots, returning client feedback\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1179\" height=\"1177\">\n          </figure>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"tst__nav\">\n          <button class=\"tst__arrow\" id=\"rvPrev\" aria-label=\"Scroll reviews back\">←</button>\n          <button class=\"tst__arrow\" id=\"rvNext\" aria-label=\"Scroll reviews forward\">→</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n<section class=\"sig-visit sig-wrap\" id=\"visit\" aria-labelledby=\"visit-title\"><div class=\"sig-visit-photo\" data-reveal><img src=\"/assets/images/bg/about-960.webp\" alt=\"The Soie sign inside the clinic\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div data-reveal style=\"--delay:80ms\"><p class=\"sig-eyebrow\">03 / Visit Soie</p><h2 class=\"sig-section-title\" id=\"visit-title\">We look forward to meeting you.</h2><p class=\"sig-section-copy\">Choose the branch that suits you. Our team will help with your questions and arrange your appointment.</p><div class=\"sig-branches\">{{homeBranches}}</div><a href=\"/book\" class=\"sig-text-link\" data-open-booking><span>Plan your visit</span><svg class=\"sig-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#sig-arrow\"></use></svg></a></div></section>\n",
